(card "exp:H-R1-2_pre_avg_amount_sizing" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:H-R1-2_pre_avg_amount_sizing"
  :body "---\nnav: 14\ntype: experiment\nid: H-R1-2\nshort_name: pre_avg_amount_sizing\ntitle: \"H-R1-2 — size = clip(pre_avg_amount / 1.3M, 0.5, 1.5)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: h\nround: r1\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_h__sizing]]\"\ntrain_nav: 1.7561\ntrain_trade_count: 140\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8571\ntrain_sharpe: 6.2057\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0066\nval_nav_mean: 1.0408\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0470\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: null\ntest_trade_count: null\ntest_sharpe: null\ntest_win_rate: null\ntest_max_drawdown: null\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: falsified\noutcome: no_test_run\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [sizing]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T02:00:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/h, round/r1, axis/sizing, status/falsified, outcome/no_test_run, leak/clean, size/medium]\n---\n\n# H-R1-2 — size = clip(pre_avg_amount / 1.3M, 0.5, 1.5)\n\n> **TL;DR** —— H-R1 sweep 第二档：试 \"pre-trigger 5min 平均成交量\"作 size proxy，normalize by anchor cap 1.3M。**train NAV 1.76 << anchor 2.19**（连 train 都没赢），没进 test。**反例**：volume-based size 在该 arc 上不是 productive proxy，反不如 ratio/median 信号干净。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- pre-trigger 平均成交量大 = 流动性好 = 滑点小 = 应当 size 大；反之 size 小。\n- size proxy = `pre_avg_amount / baseline_max_avg (1.3M)`，clip [0.5, 1.5]。\n- 期待：与 ratio/median 提供独立信号 → 两条 sizing axis 可以拼。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_h/scripts/round_1_runner.py`\n- trade selector = anchor G2 (140 笔)\n- 公式：\n  $$ \\text{size}(t) = \\mathrm{clip}\\!\\left(\\frac{\\text{pre\\_avg\\_amt}_t}{1{,}300{,}000},\\; 0.5,\\; 1.5\\right) $$\n- mean_size = 0.657（远低于 1，因 anchor pool 大部分 leg pre_avg < 1.3M）。\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- pre_avg_amount 本身已是 trigger 前 5min 窗口的 quantity，**结构上已 past-only**（不取自当前 leg 之后的数据）。\n- 无 lookahead 风险。`#leak/clean`。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 1.7561 | 140 | 6.21 | 85.7% | -0.66% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0408 ± 0.047 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | NOT RUN | - | - | - | - |\n| **Δ train NAV vs anchor** | **-0.432 (LOSE)** | 0 | -1.50 | 0 | +0.36pp |\n\ntrain 输 anchor 0.43 → engineer 直接砍 R1-2，未 push hold-out。\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0（gate 都未到 test 阶段）。\n- 真正问题：**proxy 选错** —— mean_size 0.66 说明 size 平均被压到 anchor 的 2/3，等于 systemic deleveraging，NAV 当然降。要让这条 proxy 有意义，必须 normalize by **leg-specific** baseline 而非全 pool 共用 1.3M。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n- **falsified_by**: train NAV 不过 anchor → 直接砍\n- **competes_with_failed**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R1-3__ratio_vol_blend]] (同 R1 sweep, 也输 anchor)\n- **dominated_by**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R1-1__rolling_30d_median_solo]] (R1 唯一胜出档)\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_h/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (R1-2)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- **anti-pattern**: 用 **全 pool 共用 normalizer**（这里 1.3M）作 sizing denominator 会把 mean_size 拖偏 → systemic deleveraging。\n- 下次类似 idea 要么：(1) per-ticker 5d 平均量作 normalizer，(2) per-leg 历史 pre_avg quantile 作 normalizer。**绝对不要拿固定常数**。\n- volume-based sizing 在 alpha_second_v1 这套 trade pool 上的\"低 alpha density\"特征下可能本就不 productive —— 因为大部分 trade 是 short-horizon 信号，5min pre-volume 与 NAV 关联弱。如果要复活，建议先 grep 历史 trade 上 `pre_avg_amt` 与 trade NAV 的 spearman corr。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_h__H-R1-2__pre_avg_amount_sizing.md"
  :source_mtime "2026-05-17T10:18:42+08:00"
